  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: 
  title: Beautification
  headliner: "<b>Mayor \"Mang Danny\" Sparks Outrage With \u201CBeautification\u201D
    On City's Historic Street Art</b>"
  bodyText: "In a controversial move to \"beautify\" the city, Mayor Johan \"Mang
    Danny\" has officially launched a sweeping cleanup initiative aimed at erasing
    all graffiti and public street art across New Manila. \r\n\r\nThe announcement
    has triggered an immediate backlash from community groups, art historians, and
    locals, who argue that destroying culturally significant masterpieces in the
    name of cleanliness is a tragic blow to the city's soul. "
  externalLinkBodyText: 
  hasExternalLink: 0
  customComments:
  - OH HELL NAH ! NOT MY ART !
  - TOUCH A SINGLE SPECK OF PAINT AND YOUR DEAD !
  - I'm not against beautification, but this aint it.
